{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0296","name":"毕公","evidence":["wudi-q-o146"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o146-wudi-p0296","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o146"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-o146","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d76d93442b18138d5f40","layer":"original","quote":"朕以眇眇之身，托于兆民之上，永思厥艰，若涉渊（冰）〔水〕〖86〗。非君攸济，朕无任焉。今以冀州之河东、河内、魏郡、赵国、中山、常山、钜鹿、安平、甘陵、平原凡十郡〖87〗，封君为魏公；锡君玄土〖88〗，苴以白茅〖89〗；爰契尔龟〖90〗，用建冢社〖91〗。昔在周室，毕公、毛公入为卿佐〖92〗，周、邵师保出为二伯〖93〗。外内之任，君实宜之；其以丞相领冀州牧如故。又加君九锡〖94〗，其敬听朕命：","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":114,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
